<div class="page-wrap">

  <header class="header">
    <div class="header-eyebrow">Climate &amp; Marine Science · Global Ocean Health Assessment</div>
    <h1 class="header-title">Multi-Indicator Ocean Health Deterioration, 1990–2024</h1>
    <p class="header-subtitle">Four independent indicators of compound marine ecosystem stress overlaid on aligned time axes with independent scales. Rising temperature anomaly, declining pH, collapsing coral coverage, and accelerating plastic accumulation converge to illustrate simultaneous deterioration from distinct causal pathways.</p>
  </header>

  <!-- KPI strip -->
  <div class="kpi-strip">
    <div class="kpi-card temp">
